OL,3,AUS retail giant receives $1bn boost
OL,4,Afrom tariff refunds
OL,5,
OL,6,FTarget has revealed it has received
OL,7,Falmost $1bn (#733.9m) in tariff refunds
OL,8,Ffrom the US government which boosted
OL,9,Fthe retailer's latest profits.
OL,11,FThe American chain said it received a
OL,12,F$994 million pre-tax reimbursement,
OL,13,Fwhich resulted in its second quarter
OL,14,Foperating income doubling to $2.6bn
OL,15,Ffrom $1.3bn last year.
OL,17,FTarget is the latest of many businesses
OL,18,Fboth large and small being given tax
OL,19,Frebates on goods imported to the US
OL,20,Ffollowing a Supreme Court ruling that
OL,21,Fdeclared a wave of President Donald
OL,22,FTrump's import tariffs were unlawful.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
